'''Firecracker''' (花火玉, ''Hanabidama'', '''Firework Ball''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Firecracker
|image = E 598.png
|appearance = [[Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's]]<br>
[[Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 593¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has rather low health and attack power, even at high magnifications. Combined with its abysmal range, its only purpose is to temporarily knockback and slow a few meatshields that happened to be on the frontlines. Notably, however, its attack covers an area double the size of its attack range, meaning it will always be able to hit a few meatshields or other short-ranged cats ahead of its target.

==Strategy==
It generally isn't much of a threat as its overall stats are simply ignorable.

