==Trivia==
*This enemy is based off of the Yonshakudama firework shell, which broke a record for the largest firework shell in the world.
**This is also shown with its death animation which creates a huge firework.
*Firecracker, [[Super Metal Hippoe]] and [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]] are the only enemy units whose knockback animations have multiple frames.
**[[Dark Emperor Nyandam]], [[Director Kurosawah]], [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecat]], [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigo]], [[Manic Lion Cat (Enemy)|Manic Lion Cat]] and [[The 9th Angel (Enemy)|The 9th Angel]] are all internally set to have knockback animations that last more than 1 frame, however they still remain static when knocked back.

